    "1. 按右上「校正資料夾」\n2. 讓 Claude 或本機 LLM 連到這個資料夾\n3. 複製下面的指令貼給它\n4. 它存檔後，字幕稿會自動更新" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Click Proofreading Folder at the top right\n2. Point Claude or a local LLM at that folder\n3. Copy a prompt below and paste it in\n4. When it saves, the transcript updates by itself"
          }
        }
      }
    },
