    "按「合成字幕輸出」後，到「輸出」分頁把影片卡片直接拖進 Threads 等網頁的上傳框就完成了。發完可以標記「已上傳」，舊影片可以封存。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Press Export with captions, then open the Export tab and drag the card straight into the upload box on Threads or anywhere else. Mark it Uploaded when it's posted, and archive the ones you're done with."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「範圍」，直接在畫面上拖曳框選要錄的地方。開「9:16」可以鎖定直式。框好之後，範圍外圍會有一圈淡淡的虛線提醒你。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Press Region and drag on screen over the part you want to record. Turn on 9:16 to lock it upright. Once set, a faint dashed outline marks the region."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按「範圍」，直接在畫面上拖曳框選要錄的地方。開「9:16」可以鎖定直式。框好之後，範圍外圍會有一圈淡淡的虛線提醒你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「輸出影片」後，到「輸出」分頁把影片卡片直接拖進 Threads 等網頁的上傳框就完成了。發完可以標記「已上傳」，舊影片可以封存。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Press Export video, then open the Export tab and drag the card straight into the upload box on Threads or anywhere else. Mark it Uploaded when it's posted, and archive the ones you're done with."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按「輸出影片」後，到「輸出」分頁把影片卡片直接拖進 Threads 等網頁的上傳框就完成了。發完可以標記「已上傳」，舊影片可以封存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「錄影」或 ⇧⌘R 開始，再按一次停止，可以連續錄好幾段。喇叭和麥克風按鈕可以各自開關，決定要不要錄電腦聲音、你的旁白。第一次錄影時，macOS 會請你允許「螢幕與系統錄音」權限。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Press Record or ⇧⌘R to start and again to stop; record as many takes as you like. The speaker and microphone buttons toggle separately, so you choose whether to capture your Mac's sound, your voice, or both. The first time you record, macOS asks you to allow Screen & System Audio Recording."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按「錄影」或 ⇧⌘R 開始，再按一次停止，可以連續錄好幾段。喇叭和麥克風按鈕可以各自開關，決定要不要錄電腦聲音、你的旁白。第一次錄影時，macOS 會請你允許「螢幕與系統錄音」權限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
