    "讀這個資料夾的 README.md 和 projects.md，然後幫下面每個專案各寫一則 Threads 貼文：開頭一句抓注意力、三個重點、結尾一個提問，500 字以內，語氣口語。先把所有字幕讀完，可以跨專案參考前後文補足背景，但每則貼文只講自己那支影片的內容。備註是我提供的背景（場合、日期、人物），請寫進貼文並以備註為準。每則貼文存成箭頭後面的檔名，只放貼文內文。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Read README.md and projects.md in this folder, then write one Threads post for each project below: a hook in the first line, three key points, and a closing question. Under 500 characters, conversational tone. Read all the captions first — you can use other projects for background, but each post should only cover its own video. The notes are background I provided (occasion, date, people): work them into the post and treat them as correct. Save each post to the file name after the arrow, post text only."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "讀這個資料夾的 README.md、glossary.md 和 projects.md，然後校正下面所有專案的字幕檔。先把它們全部讀完：這些影片可能是同一場合或同一系列，請互相參考前後文、人名、機構與術語來判斷正確寫法，備註是我提供的背景，以備註為準（不確定的請上網查證）。每個檔案只改自己的文字，不要改編號、時間軸和句數，改完各自存回原檔。最後依檔案列出你改了哪些句子，以及沒把握所以沒改的地方。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Read README.md, glossary.md and projects.md in this folder, then proofread the caption files of all the projects below. Read them all first: these videos may come from the same event or series, so use each other's context, names, organizations and terms to work out the correct spellings. The notes are background I provided — treat them as correct (look things up if unsure). Only change each file's own text; don't change the numbers, timestamps or line count, and save each one back to its own file. Finally, list per file the lines you changed and anything you weren't sure about."
          }
        }
      }
