        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Click a clip on the left to play and trim it here"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "點片段，拖曳膠卷條兩端的黃色把手剪掉頭尾；按「在這裡剪開」（⌘B）可以把黃色區塊切成兩塊，拉開後中間會被跳過。也可以匯入現有的影片。左右拖動縮圖可以排順序，往下拖到「暫存區」就不會放進這次輸出。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Click a clip and drag the yellow handles at either end of the filmstrip to trim it. Split here (⌘B) cuts the yellow range in two, and pulling the halves apart skips what's between. You can import videos you already have. Drag thumbnails left and right to reorder, or down into Set aside to leave them out of this export."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "點片段，拖曳膠卷條兩端的黃色把手剪掉頭尾；按「在這裡剪開」（⌘B）可以把黃色區塊切成兩塊，拉開後中間會被跳過。也可以匯入現有的影片。左右拖動縮圖可以排順序，往下拖到「暫存區」就不會放進這次輸出。"
          }
        }
      }
